                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "9 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I found this restaurant while walking to Lungshan Temple. It’s a very local-style noodle shop, and the only English sign I saw was “Cash Only.” I solved the language barrier by pointing at pictures to order my food. They offer many kinds of Taiwanese noodles—some in spicy mala broth, others in peanut-based, and some loaded with beef and wontons in huge portions! Super comforting and totally worth a try.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
